):\r\n        if sign == 1:\r\n            terms.append(i)\r\n        else:\r\n            terms.append(-i)\r\n        sign *= -1\r\n\r\n    return sum(terms)\n\nresult = calculate_expression()\nprint((result, 55 ** (1 / 2) * (3 - 55)))\n```\n```output\n(48, -34.585/17)\n```\nWe find that the absolute value of the result is \\(\\boxed{46}\\).",
